<%# A thick coloured tab down one edge is the callout pattern the design system
    rules out, so the tone reads from the title's colour and the card keeps the
    same hairline as every other piece. Title in Quicksand, not Baloo: an alert
    title is a sentence, and Display-For-Names reserves Baloo for named things. %>
<div class="bg-surface border border-border-strong <%= tone_classes %> rounded-2xl p-4">
  <p class="text-t5 font-bold <%= tone_classes.split.last %> mb-1"><%= @title %></p>
  <div class="text-tan text-t5"><%= content %></div>
</div>
